# One Item, Different Alignment

`align-self` takes the same values as `align-items` but applies only to that specific flex item. It overrides the container's `align-items`.

```css
.special {
  align-self: flex-end;
}
```
Great for positioning a single element differently (like a button at the bottom of a card).
